SUMMARY:Youth Group
DESCRIPTION:Let’s celebrate friendship\, good food and gratitude at our very own Friendsgiving! Bring a favorite dish\, dessert\, or side to share\, and invite a friend to join in the fun. The more\, the merrier! \nWe’ll fill the table\, enjoy some great food\, and take time to celebrate the people and things we’re thankful for. Then we’re heading into the kitchen to create our own custom snack mixes to take home. You’ll be ready to be the snack hero at your next tailgate\, holiday gathering\, or family get-together! \nCome hungry\, bring a friend\, and get ready for a fun night of food\, creativity\, and time together! Please RSVP by November 13 so we know how much food and how many supplies to have ready. Click here to let us know you’ll be attending. \n\n\nNew Topics Every Month\nOpen to all 6th–12th graders\, Youth Group meets every third Sunday of the month from 5:00 – 6:30 PM. Dinner is provided\, so bring your appetite\, bring a friend\, and get ready for a fun evening. We’ll provide dinner and good vibes\, just come hungry and curious. \nFor more information\, click here to email StephJo Wise\, Director of Children\, Youth and Families.
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/youth-group-launch-2-2/
LOCATION:Saint James Parish House\, 119 North Duke Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Youth
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Friendsgiving-FEATURED-IMAGE-copy.jpg
GEO:40.0404103;-76.303616
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Saint James Parish House 119 North Duke Street Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=119 North Duke Street:geo:-76.303616,40.0404103
END:VEVENT
